      "polity": "Ukrainian SSR",
      "summary": "In February 1954 the Crimean Oblast was transferred from the Russian SFSR to the Ukrainian SSR, giving Ukraine its current borders. The Khrushchev thaw and the 'Sixtiers' dissidents were followed by Brezhnev-era Russification and arrests. The Chernobyl disaster (1986) and Gorbachev's glasnost energized the Rukh movement, and on 16 July 1990 Ukraine declared state sovereignty.",
